<% content_for :description, "Tom Garrett — technical product manager in Dublin. Case studies in voice infrastructure, personal wealth, AI legal intelligence and workflow automation." %>

<%# ── Hero ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── %>
<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-20 pb-16 sm:px-8 sm:pt-28 sm:pb-24">
  <p class="eyebrow">Technical product management · Design — code — product</p>

  <h1 class="mt-6 max-w-4xl font-display text-[2.6rem] font-semibold leading-[1.02] tracking-tight text-ink-950 sm:text-[4rem] lg:text-[4.6rem]">
    I designed, built, and then audited every system on this site.
  </h1>

  <div class="mt-9 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.35fr_1fr] lg:items-start lg:gap-16">
    <div class="max-w-xl space-y-4 text-[1.06rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-500">
      <p>
        I'm <span class="font-medium text-ink-900">Tom Garrett</span>, a technical product manager
        with ten years across design, code and product. I'm Director of Product Engineering at
        <span class="font-medium text-ink-900">DepositCloud</span>, a regulated US rental-payments
        platform serving 250,000+ customers, where I own the roadmap across three applications —
        discovery and scoping through to what actually ships.
      </p>
      <p>
        Before that I founded DocuDynamics and took it from idea to funded MVP in five months.
        I advise early-stage Irish companies on product, and I still write the code — so I spec
        against real constraints rather than around them, and the case studies below are about
        what the systems actually do, not what the slides said they would.
      </p>
    </div>

    <%# The one photograph on the site, given the same framed-window treatment as
        the case-study covers so it reads as part of the existing language rather
        than as an avatar dropped on top of it. Capped narrower than its column:
        the portrait should balance the bio beside it, not tower over it. %>
    <div class="max-w-[15rem] sm:max-w-[16rem] lg:max-w-[17rem] lg:pt-1">
      <img src="/tom-garrett.png" alt="Tom Garrett"
           width="928" height="1152" decoding="async"
           class="block aspect-[4/5] w-full rounded-lg border border-ink-100 bg-panel object-cover object-top shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(11,13,16,.05),0_18px_40px_-28px_rgba(11,13,16,.5)]">
    </div>
  </div>

  <dl class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-7 border-t border-ink-100 pt-8 sm:grid-cols-4">
    <% [
         ["250k+", "Customers on the platform I lead product for"],
         ["3", "Applications, one distributed team of 8"],
         ["900+", "Merged PRs across 24 months"],
         ["2 wks → 4 hrs", "Release cycle after re-architecting CI/CD"]
       ].each do |value, label| %>
      <div>
        <dt class="sr-only"><%= label %></dt>
        <dd>
          <span class="block font-display text-[1.6rem] font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight text-ink-950"><%= value %></span>
          <span class="mt-2 block text-[0.78rem] leading-snug text-ink-400"><%= label %></span>
        </dd>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </dl>

  <div class="mt-11 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
    <%= link_to work_index_path, class: "inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-ink-950 px-5 py-2.5 text-[0.92rem] font-medium text-paper transition hover:bg-ink-700" do %>
      See the work
      <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M4 10h11m0 0-4-4m4 4-4 4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      </svg>
    <% end %>
    <a href="<%= contact[:cv] %>" download
       class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-ink-200 px-5 py-2.5 text-[0.92rem] font-medium text-ink-900 transition hover:border-ink-950">
      Download CV
      <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M10 3.5v10m0 0 3.5-3.5M10 13.5 6.5 10M4 16.5h12" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      </svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<%# ── Selected work ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── %>
<section id="work" class="border-t border-ink-100 bg-panel">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-24">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-2xl font-display text-[2rem] font-semibold leading-tight text-ink-950 sm:text-[2.5rem]">
          Four products, and what each one actually did
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-sm text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-500">
        Each case study covers what was built, the decisions and their cost, and what I would
        do next — including the parts that are still wrong.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 space-y-20 sm:space-y-24">
      <% @case_studies.each_with_index do |case_study, i| %>
        <%= render "shared/case_study_card", case_study: case_study, reverse: i.odd? %>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%# ── How I work ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── %>
<section class="border-t border-ink-100">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">How I work</p>
    <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-2xl font-display text-[2rem] font-semibold leading-tight text-ink-950 sm:text-[2.5rem]">
      Discovery, then a measurable release
    </h2>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-x-12 gap-y-12 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <% [
           ["01", "Discovery &amp; validation",
            "User research, UX prototyping and session analysis, then data-led decisions about what to scale and what to kill. Prototyping in production, and measuring honestly."],
           ["02", "Experimentation &amp; rollout",
            "Feature flags with analytics as the standard launch mechanism — every significant feature ships behind a flag with success metrics defined before it goes out."],
           ["03", "Delivery &amp; roadmapping",
            "Agile planning across timezones, multi-phase initiative scoping, and a release cycle short enough that shipping is a product decision rather than a scheduling constraint."],
           ["04", "Regulated-domain product",
            "US FinTech and PropTech: SOC 2 Type I, penetration testing and vulnerability scanning wired into CI. Compliance treated as a product requirement, not an afterthought."],
           ["05", "Integration design",
            "Two-way API integrations with the property-management systems that unlock enterprise accounts — Yardi, Entrata, RealPage, Rent Manager — plus Twilio, Stripe and Salesforce."],
           ["06", "Building it myself",
            "Ruby on Rails, React, Node, SQL, GCP and CI/CD. Close enough to the implementation that a roadmap estimate is informed by the code rather than inferred from it."]
         ].each do |num, title, body| %>
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-[0.7rem] text-ink-300"><%= num %></span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-[1.15rem] font-semibold text-ink-950"><%= title.html_safe %></h3>
          <p class="mt-2.5 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-500"><%= body %></p>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%# ── Contact ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── %>
<section class="border-t border-ink-100 bg-ink-950 text-paper">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-8 px-6 py-20 sm:px-8">
    <div>
      <p class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ink-400">Get in touch</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 max-w-2xl font-display text-[2rem] font-semibold leading-tight sm:text-[2.6rem]">
        Happy to talk about product, delivery, or any of the systems above.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="mailto:<%= contact[:email] %>"
         class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-paper px-5 py-2.5 text-[0.92rem] font-medium text-ink-950 transition hover:bg-ink-100">
        <%= contact[:email] %>
      </a>
      <a href="<%= contact[:linkedin] %>" rel="noopener"
         class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-ink-700 px-5 py-2.5 text-[0.92rem] font-medium text-paper transition hover:border-paper">
        LinkedIn
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
